# Shatter overlay. Blocks stacked top to bottom, reference ancillas below.
# data = gold/orange, X check = lightcoral, Z check = cornflowerblue, reference = violet.
# 2 blocks: bb (144d+144a), bb (144d+144a) with 34 stitching gauges.
